{"availability":"available","full":"moooff/HermitUI","name":"HermitUI","description":"Run local LLMs entirely in your browser, with no server, no install and no traces. A private, single-file AI chat UI and AGENT that also works with any OpenAI-compatible API.","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":9,"forks":3,"created":"2026-06-24T21:14:43Z","updated":"2026-10-13T19:12:32Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["agentic-ai","air-gapped","air-gapped-ai","chat-ui","gguf","harness","in-browser-llm","local-llm","offline-first","openai-api","privacy-first","self-hosted","self-hosted-ai","single-file","webgpu","zero-telemetry"],"demo":"https://moooff.github.io/HermitUI/dist/hermit-ui-wllama.html#gguf=hf:unsloth/Qwen3-0.6B-GGUF/Qwen3-0.6B-Q4_K_M.gguf","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T21:32:32.162Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T21:32:32.162Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T21:32:32.162Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:15:44.748Z","stars":9,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:42:57.436Z","stars":9,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:03:00.493Z","stars":9,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-11T00:22:56.377Z","stars":9,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-16T21:32:32.162Z","stars":9,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A lightweight, modern, and ephemeral single-page web interface for local AI models.","In-browser inference with WebGPU acceleration: the model downloads straight into memory (timelapsed) and the answer streams in real time.","Left: connect it to your local AI server. Middle: one click downloads a small but capable model (Qwen3-0.6B, 380 MB) and chats fully inside your browser — no server at all. Right: the agent — hand a task to your model and watch it solve it step by step in a Python sandbox."],"features":["🧠 It runs models itself. GGUF models execute entirely in your browser via llama.cpp compiled to WebAssembly, with WebGPU acceleration. A 12.1 GB model loads in a tab and decodes at 43 tok/s — and we measured it…","🔒 It stores absolutely nothing. No localStorage, no IndexedDB, no cookies, no model cache, no telemetry. Close the tab and the conversation and the model are gone — and you can check that in a minute.","📦 Zero-dependency setup: all external libraries (Marked.js, DOMPurify, Highlight.js, KaTeX, Mermaid) and the Inter font are bundled directly into the file. No installation, no build step. (A CDN-linked developer…","🔒 Privacy first & ephemeral: no localStorage, IndexedDB, or cookies — nothing survives the tab.","🧠 Thinking-model support: built-in parser formats , , and tags as they stream from reasoning models."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/moooff/HermitUI/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"74fc539f246910fbc7999e4e55e8a9281ba0f7eed5f8f8fcd707a78a0c69d319","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T22:55:57.326Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:38:59.937Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A lightweight, modern, and ephemeral single-page web interface for local AI models.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/moooff/HermitUI/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Configure — click ⚙️ Settings in the top right to set the API URL, model name, API key, or system prompt.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/moooff/HermitUI/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"74fc539f246910fbc7999e4e55e8a9281ba0f7eed5f8f8fcd707a78a0c69d319","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/moooff/HermitUI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:38:59.940Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T15:16:49Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/moooff/HermitUI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:38:59.944Z","hash":"74fc539f246910fbc7999e4e55e8a9281ba0f7eed5f8f8fcd707a78a0c69d319","originalBytes":40934,"storedBytes":40934,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:44.748Z","qualityPriority":false,"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T21:35